```
===================================================================
Detection Name: Obfuscated PowerShell Download Cradle
Author: SOC Team
Data Source: index=edr_sysmon (Sysmon Operational Event Logs)
Event ID: 1 (ProcessCreate)
MITRE ATT&CK: T1059 (Command and Scripting Interpreter: PowerShell)
Severity: High
Description: Detects PowerShell executions containing download cradle 
             methods (Invoke-WebRequest, DownloadString, Net.WebClient)
             often launched with stealth flags (-W Hidden, -NonI, -NoP).
===================================================================
```
index=edr_sysmon EventCode=1 (Image="*\\powershell.exe" OR Image="*\\pwsh.exe") 
(CommandLine="*Invoke-WebRequest*" OR CommandLine="*DownloadString*" OR CommandLine="*Net.WebClient*" OR CommandLine="*-W Hidden*")
| table _time, host, User, ParentImage, CommandLine
| sort - _time
